        "original_id": "cff8566c-c472-531e-94c6-98a4d14dead1",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tim Allen, Christian Slater, Richard Dreyfuss, Chris Ver Wiel\n- Films and TV series: Who Is Cletis Tout?, Home Improvement, Last Man Standing, Toy Story franchise, The Santa Clause trilogy\n- Roles: Tim \"The Toolman\" Taylor, Mike Baxter, Buzz Lightyear, Scott Calvin/Santa Claus\n\nFacts:\n- Tim Allen, born Timothy Allen Dick on June 13, 1953, is an American actor and comedian.\n- Tim Allen played Tim \"The Toolman\" Taylor on Home Improvement from 1991 to 1999.\n- Tim Allen began voicing Buzz Lightyear in the Toy Story franchise in 1995.\n- Tim Allen played Scott Calvin/Santa Claus in The Santa Clause trilogy from 1994 to 2006.\n- Who Is Cletis Tout? is a 2001 American-Canadian action comedy film written and directed by Chris Ver Wiel and starring Christian Slater, Richard Dreyfuss, and Tim Allen.\n- Tim Allen played Mike Baxter on Last Man Standing from 2011 to 2017.",
